BEGIN_HYPERDESC
<h1>OSG Sim Moon descent experiment (UNVALIDATED)</h1>
<p>Proposed physics-only contact test for SpaceXpanse Metaverse v0.1.6a x64.
The initial position/velocity and ShuttlePB touchdown configuration require native validation.
The scenario is not evidence that the lander actually touches the Moon.</p>
END_HYPERDESC

BEGIN_ENVIRONMENT
  System Sol
  Date MJD 51982.1301160012
END_ENVIRONMENT

BEGIN_FOCUS
  Ship OSG-Lander
END_FOCUS

BEGIN_CAMERA
  TARGET OSG-Lander
  MODE Extern
  POS 12.00 15.00 -27.00
  TRACKMODE TargetRelative
  FOV 40.00
END_CAMERA

BEGIN_HUD
  TYPE Surface
END_HUD

BEGIN_MFD Left
  TYPE Surface
END_MFD

BEGIN_MFD Right
  TYPE Orbit
  REF Moon
  PROJ Ship
END_MFD

BEGIN_SHIPS
OSG-Lander:ShuttlePB
  STATUS Orbiting Moon
  RPOS 1739000.0 0.0 0.0
  RVEL -10.0 0.0 0.0
  AROT 0.0 0.0 0.0
  PRPLEVEL 0:1.000 1:1.000
  NAVFREQ 0 0
END
END_SHIPS
